      "solution": {
        "lines": [
          "$1 = \\dfrac{20}{20}$ .",
          "$\\dfrac{1}{10} = \\dfrac{1 \\times 2}{10 \\times 2} = \\dfrac{2}{20}$ .",
          "ما أُخذ : $\\dfrac{1}{10} + \\dfrac{7}{20} + \\dfrac{3}{20} = \\dfrac{2 + 7 + 3}{20} = \\dfrac{12}{20}$ .",
          "الباقي : $1 - \\dfrac{12}{20} = \\dfrac{20}{20} - \\dfrac{12}{20} = \\dfrac{8}{20}$ .",
          "نختزل : $\\dfrac{2}{5}$ ."
        ],
